      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c809850cd7908d610953cdeb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我居然也能拥有\n像这样了不起的支持者了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84463d6f606108d32f130a70646ba8e673844a55d275a8fc4168ef65aed6246d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100306.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b6597ed66206ef750347b96",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛结束后，我感受到了──\n“最低限度的条件已经达成了。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5c7943508a014d5a8a964c3804ae387ab8cab380c025bc31c2850a1560a0b94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100306.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4f041de5674c070f4e6a681",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不再有区分经典级和古马级的高墙。\n我们可以挑战所有的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30d919d7330bfa0bf9fd1d0bd679fa85e548cf49b9f31df4e68059cb30c66afe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100306.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9043188b65bbc60647360fca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后──\n奇锐骏也扛起了，\n不输给醒目飞鹰的众多心愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1184ae658b58a1d276714f80b323117997773fd7b72c0caf890ae993f1e675f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100306.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f268bf697380bc8ffca9718",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再来就看本人的意愿了──",
      "source_fingerprint": "09a3e75bd21aef49a9f8ef233f3a5292e804cfb9f67b651ebf1ddeca32be31a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100306.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ec89b3950a3120cf3f67cd0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏",
      "source_fingerprint": "a207abcfd80fb4fb6f8d31f126614b1c06f6c929c600c2ce53b7c13145067eb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
