      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:471afb0ca109139f3be54ffd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我才应该要谢谢你才对，奇锐骏。\n谢谢你让我看了一场精彩的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd1e10d932a7c942a5e397595ddfc803fab6454ad8cfe648070d26a9bbf1f4f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100306.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2fcd3c549876bcb2a85d58a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来当事人也干劲十足。\n至于是否真能追上她──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d00140e201048f939a236caa0fa26848c6d5f3b1ea2487ad6bc02f7615660b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100306.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
