      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以奇锐骏的角度来看，\n我们是一路狂奔才走到了这一步。\n这都多亏她撑过了激烈训练……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1de9e177f90b5436e1876b2d63246dde24003c1e96ee61bb30db745332732e12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
