      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏今天也在比赛中\n展露了她深藏不露的光芒，\n但除此之外──",
      "source_fingerprint": "7aa7fb5ae956ecbb2d7052a5d5f19495ad8b7e55301c5877f8a6f10d8478f35e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
